  "readmeExcerpt": "# @open-mercato/onboarding 🚀\n\nTenant onboarding and first-run experience for Open Mercato.\n\n`@open-mercato/onboarding` helps orchestrate setup flows, initial configuration, defaults, and guided adoption steps.\n\n## Why this package ✨\n\n- 🪄 Guided tenant bootstrap experience\n- 🧩 Hooks for setup defaults and example data\n- 📬 Supports welcome and invitation-style flows\n- ⚡ Reduces time-to-value for new installations\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nyarn add @open-mercato/onboarding\n```\n\n## Learn more\n\n- GitHub (package): https://github.com/open-mercato/open-mercato/tree/main/packages/onboarding\n- GitHub (project): https://github.com/open-mercato/open-mercato\n- Docs: https://docs.openmercato.com\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n",
